Retained-format input for test_p0_longrun_judge.py.

nodeN.STEP.log are server stderr pieces in the plain and the verbose
(log_error_verbosity=verbose) format. The test concatenates them per member
and records the piece boundaries as step offsets. Messages are ones the
product emits, except the "sample failure 4242" record in node2.load.log and
client-errors.jsonl: it is deliberately quoted by no rule, and a run that
contains it must be refused and must list it as unclassified.
